{
     "name": "The Ark Bible",
     "short_name": "Ark Bible",
     "description": "☀️The Ark Bible App is an online searchable Bible App. It offers many different versions of the Bible in many different languages. It also offers other functionality, including a 365 day chronological reading plan, a computer text to speech synthesis to listen, so you can listen to the Bible, and a comparison function, so you can compare two different versions of the Bible on the same page.",
